the-firm-as-one-program-14 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-14 = unlines (cons "- **P3** Transport of whole structures along equivalences (hyperactivity v31 §3–4)." (cons "  Equality is something the language computes with. An equivalence between two representations becomes a path between them, and transport along the path carries an entire structure across at once: its operations, their laws, the programs that use them and the proofs about those programs. Changing representation stops being a rewrite and becomes an operation (hyperactivity v31 §3, §4)." nil))
